col label that has at least one dynamic coefficient) gets its own AR(1)
parameters \eqn{\rho_\beta} (truncated-Normal prior, default mean 0.8,
bounded between 0 and 0.999) and \eqn{\sigma_\beta^2} (inverse-Gamma
